              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਛੱਤ (chhatt) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from chatti, \"covering\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 4971). It is built on the Sanskrit root chad, \"to cover\"."
